{"format":"kards-original-reference","version":1,"id":"c15171de12703f31","name":"card_event_swift_victory","package":"/Game/Blueprints/Cards/Japan/Homefront/events/card_event_swift_victory","parent":"UBaseCardObject","card":{"title":"SWIFT VICTORY","text":"Deal 3 damage. Units in the enemy deck get +3 attack.","flavorText":"In the first six months of the Pacific War, Japan achieved stunning victories across Asia and the Pacific. Its forces captured Hong Kong, Malaya, the Philippines, the Dutch East Indies, and Burma with speed and coordination. These offensives seized vital resources and dealt heavy blows to Allied morale.But the rapid expansion soon exposed deep logistical problems. Japan didn’t have enough ships or infrastructure to support its troops across such a wide area. Supply lines became overextended, and fuel and ammunition shortages grew worse. As Allied forces regrouped, Japanese soldiers in distant garrisons faced dwindling supplies and limited reinforcements. Their swift victory gave Japan a vast empire, but not the means to sustain it.","faction":"Japan","type":"order","rarity":"Unique","cost":1,"operationCost":0,"attack":0,"defense":0},"defaults":{"UberGraphFrame":{},"Name":"card_event_swift_victory","title":{"Namespace":"card_japan","Key":"card_event_swift_victory_title","SourceString":"SWIFT VICTORY","LocalizedString":"SWIFT VICTORY"},"Type":"ETypeEnum::order","faction":"EFactionEnum::Japan","kredits":1,"Text":{"Namespace":"card_japan","Key":"card_event_swift_victory_text","SourceString":"Deal 3 damage. Units in the enemy deck get +3 attack.","LocalizedString":"Deal 3 damage. Units in the enemy deck get +3 attack."},"flavorText":{"Namespace":"card_japan","Key":"card_event_swift_victory_history","SourceString":"In the first six months of the Pacific War, Japan achieved stunning victories across Asia and the Pacific. Its forces captured Hong Kong, Malaya, the Philippines, the Dutch East Indies, and Burma with speed and coordination. These offensives